# 📚 Enterprise Document Intelligence Platform

> An AI-powered Enterprise Document Intelligence Platform that enables semantic search, Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG), and conversational question answering over enterprise documents using Large Language Models (LLMs).

---

## 🚀 Overview

Enterprise organizations manage large volumes of documents such as policies, contracts, reports, research papers, invoices, and manuals. Traditional keyword-based search often struggles to retrieve relevant information because it cannot understand the semantic meaning of text.

This project leverages **Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)**, **vector embeddings**, and **Large Language Models (LLMs)** to provide intelligent document understanding and conversational question answering.

Users can upload multiple documents, ask questions in natural language, and receive accurate, source-aware responses generated from the uploaded knowledge base.

---

## ✨ Features

- 📄 Upload multiple documents
  - PDF
  - DOCX
  - PPTX
  - Images (OCR)
- 🔍 Semantic Search
- 🤖 Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)
- 💬 Conversational Question Answering
- 📚 Multi-document Querying
- 📝 Intelligent Document Chunking
- 🖼 OCR Support using EasyOCR
- 🧠 Cross-Encoder Re-ranking
- 📌 Source-aware Responses
- 💾 ChromaDB Vector Database
- 🗄 PostgreSQL Metadata Storage
- ⚡ FastAPI Backend
- 🎨 Streamlit Frontend
- 📊 Dashboard for Document Management

---

# 🏗️ System Architecture

```
                    ┌───────────────────────────┐
                    │     Streamlit Frontend     │
                    └─────────────┬─────────────┘
                                  │
                                  ▼
                         FastAPI Backend
                                  │
          ┌───────────────────────┼────────────────────────┐
          ▼                       ▼                        ▼
  Document Upload          Metadata Storage          Chat API
          │                       │
          ▼                       ▼
      OCR (EasyOCR)         PostgreSQL Database
          │
          ▼
     Text Processing
          │
          ▼
 Intelligent Chunking
          │
          ▼
 Sentence Transformer Embeddings
          │
          ▼
   ChromaDB Vector Store
          │
          ▼
 Semantic Retrieval
          │
          ▼
 CrossEncoder Re-ranking
          │
          ▼
      Ollama LLM
          │
          ▼
 Source-aware Response
```

