# ⚙️ Installation

## Clone the Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/<your-username>/Enterprise-Document-Intelligence.git

cd Enterprise-Document-Intelligence
```

---

## Create a Virtual Environment

### Windows

```bash
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate
```

### Linux / macOS

```bash
python3 -m venv venv
source venv/bin/activate
```

---

## Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

## Configure Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file in the project root.

```env
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@localhost:5432/enterprise_document_db

OLLAMA_URL=http://localhost:11434

OLLAMA_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b
```

---

## Run Ollama

```bash
ollama serve
```

Download the required model:

```bash
ollama pull qwen2.5:3b
```

---

## Run FastAPI Backend

```bash
uvicorn backend.main:app --reload
```

API Documentation:

```
http://localhost:8000/docs
```

---

## Run Streamlit Frontend

```bash
streamlit run frontend/Home.py
```

---

# 🔄 Workflow

```
Upload Documents
        │
        ▼
Document Parsing
        │
        ▼
OCR (if required)
        │
        ▼
Text Cleaning
        │
        ▼
Document Chunking
        │
        ▼
Embedding Generation
        │
        ▼
ChromaDB Indexing
        │
        ▼
User Query
        │
        ▼
Semantic Retrieval
        │
        ▼
CrossEncoder Re-ranking
        │
        ▼
LLM Prompt Generation
        │
        ▼
Answer with Source References
```

---

# 📡 API Endpoints

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|---------|----------|-------------|
| POST | `/upload` | Upload one or more documents |
| POST | `/chat` | Ask questions about uploaded documents |
| GET | `/documents` | Retrieve uploaded documents |
| DELETE | `/documents/{id}` | Delete a document |
| GET | `/stats` | Platform statistics |

